  options: ["Tuesday appointment, blood pressure on the right arm, local haemostatic measures, acetaminophen for pain","Wednesday appointment straight after dialysis, blood pressure on the left arm, ibuprofen for pain","Friday appointment just before dialysis, blood pressure on the right arm, naproxen for pain","Monday appointment straight after dialysis, amoxicillin 2 g beforehand for the fistula, acetaminophen for pain"],
